{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D casual jump adventure game where you become an adorable bubble character exploring giant indoor worlds to complete delivery missions. Navigate as a tiny bubble through realistic-sized rooms, jumping between furniture and obstacles to safely deliver packages to your destination. Explore 2 different zones within time limits, and when you get lost, friendly insect NPCs will help guide your way. When you hit obstacles, you'll respawn at safe checkpoints, making it enjoyable for players of all skill levels. Master precise jumping and timing to overcome challenging sections and become the perfect delivery agent!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000410?t=1758078167","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000410?t=1758078167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000410/ae13d3ffb494194012676b9f53c43fb19a2a5904/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758078167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000410/ae13d3ffb494194012676b9f53c43fb19a2a5904/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758078167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D casual jump adventure game where you become an adorable bubble character exploring giant indoor worlds to complete delivery missions. Navigate as a tiny bubble through realistic-sized rooms, jumping between furniture and obstacles to safely deliver packages to your destination. Explore 2 different zones within time limits, and when you get lost, friendly insect NPCs will help guide your way. When you hit obstacles, you'll respawn at safe checkpoints, making it enjoyable for players of all skill levels. Master precise jumping and timing to overcome challenging sections and become t